    "details": "<p>Hostelbird Hackathon</p>\n<p><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"788\">Build It. Break It. Ship It.</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>About the Hackathon</strong></p>\n<p>This is not your typical hackathon.</p>\n<p>You won&rsquo;t be solving hypothetical problems.<br data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"902\" />You&rsquo;ll be working on a <strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"965\">real product used by real travelers.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Instead, you will:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1104\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1rcbeqq\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1058\">Break what doesn&rsquo;t work</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1wblvb1\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1079\">Fix what matters</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"102rf5m\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1104\">Build what&rsquo;s missing</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If your solution is strong enough, it won&rsquo;t just win, it could <strong data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1195\">go live on the product and you can get an internship opportunity with us!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>What You&rsquo;ll Do</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Identify 3-5 bugs, UX gaps, and broken flows in the Hostelbird app.</li>\n<li>Think like a user, not just a developer</li>\n<li>Propose meaningful improvements</li>\n<li>Build and showcase your solution</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is about product thinking + execution, not just coding.</p>\n<p><strong>Download the app here:</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hostelbird.com/app-download\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">https://hostelbird.com/app-download</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></p>\n<p><strong>Hackathon Journey</strong></p>\n<p>Step 01 &mdash; Explore the Product</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1710\">\n<li data-section-id=\"tu5c8g\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1621\">Download the Hostelbird app</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ot7b1w\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1653\">Understand the user journey</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17x2f2y\" data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1710\">Identify friction points, bugs, and missing features</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Step 02 &mdash; Break It</p>\n<p>Find real issues like bugs, UX problems, edge cases and performance gaps</p>\n<p>Step 03 &mdash; Build It</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1971\">\n<li data-section-id=\"z7217y\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1894\">Fix 3-5 bugs or redesign a broken flow</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r3rin4\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1943\">Write the optimized code for it that is designed to improve user experience</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Step 04 &mdash; Submit Your Work</p>\n<p>Your submission must include:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2153\">\n<li data-section-id=\"2v9o6\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2062\">Problem identified</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"643uqj\" data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2081\">Why it matters</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4boyyo\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2099\">Your solution</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tam7qu\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2153\">Proof of implementation (code/prototype/demo)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: 600;\">Submission Format</span></p>\n<p>Participants must submit:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2466\">\n<li data-section-id=\"tk5585\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2367\">A short problem statement</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pcdztu\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2392\">Solution explanation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohfp0r\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2466\">Supporting material:\n<ul data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2466\">\n<li data-section-id=\"6w3emq\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2466\">GitHub repo/prototype/Figma/demo video</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can submit directly via Unstop or email at hr@hostelbird.com</p>\n<p><strong>Evaluation Criteria</strong></p>\n<p>Submissions will be evaluated on:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2671\">\n<li data-section-id=\"hubxy4\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2566\">Problem clarity &amp; relevance</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15vtdzw\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2588\">Depth of thinking</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ft4ck5\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2612\">Quality of solution</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14lnaef\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2640\">Execution &amp; feasibility</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tny71t\" data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2671\">Creativity &amp; product sense</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rewards</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2975\">\n<li data-section-id=\"19d1jdi\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2836\">Cash prizes upto 5000 for top winners</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19d1jdi\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2836\">Exclusive Hostelbird merchandise and gadgets</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"919l61\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2881\">Internship opportunities with Hostelbird</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ojnzsd\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2914\">Certificate of participation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1n0h11q\" data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2975\">Top solutions may be <strong data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2975\">implemented in the actual product!</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Timeline</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3185\">\n<li data-section-id=\"kk0hpy\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3095\">Registrations Open: 22 April, 2026</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"192jh7y\" data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3124\">Hackathon Starts: 24 April, 2026</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16l9y02\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3156\">Submission Deadline: 28 April, 2026</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"uhn43x\" data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3185\">Result Declaration: 16 May, 2026 At 9 PM.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3406\">\n<li data-section-id=\"nkupgz\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3254\">All submissions must be original, not AI-generated.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"263oc3\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3313\">Low-effort or superficial bug reports will be rejected</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"c94ykk\" data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3364\">Focus on meaningful improvements, not quantity</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This opportunity is for people who want to work on a real product, especially in the travel industry, solve practical problems, and turn strong code into a real career opportunity!</p>",
